201: For \(\omega_h>\omega_l>0\), put \(S(\omega)=-\operatorname{Im}H(i\omega)/\omega\). Then
202: 
203: \begin{equation}
204: S(\omega_l)\le R_\Lambda S(\omega_h),\qquad
205: R_\Lambda=\frac{1+(\omega_h/\Lambda)^2}{1+(\omega_l/\Lambda)^2}.
206: \label{eq:gap-witness}
207: \end{equation}
